## The dataset

[`data/Synthetic_Homicide.csv`](data/Synthetic_Homicide.csv) is based on:

> Krüsselmann, K., Achterberg, J., Haas, M., Spruit, M. & Liem, M. (2024). *Synthetic Dutch Homicide Monitor* [Data set]. Leiden University/LUMC. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.13378063

That dataset is released under CC BY 4.0. For this hackathon, DUO's Team Synthetische Data added seven columns to it, following business rules they made up, and made the two age columns exact; see the [data card](data/README.md). The adapted dataset is published here under the same license, CC BY 4.0. When you reuse it, credit the original source above and mention DUO's changes.

